# os-local ignore for the ts-overlay (P1-030). Scoped to THIS overlay so the rule lives next to the
# thing it governs and the diff stays within os/ (no root .gitignore edit).
#
# The Deno runtime binary is a BUILD ARTIFACT, not source: os/x86_64/ts-image.mjs fetches the
# version- + sha256-pinned upstream zip, verifies it, and stages the single `deno` executable here at
# usr/lib/vita/deno before mkosi runs `--extra-tree`. It is large and reproducible from the pin, so
# it is never committed. The committed TS sources under usr/lib/vita/ts/ (main.ts + vendor/*) and the
# systemd unit + wants-symlink stay tracked — the path below is anchored to the FILE, not the dir.
usr/lib/vita/deno
